{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f8d98d513c2c43ea530d0870ceff4231bc3880baf4517df57dfd2cfb540cb956","ja":"はい。未来たちはトークイベント。\n私たちは、バラエティ番組の収録ですね。","zh":"好的。未来她们参加访谈活动。\n我们则是录制综艺节目。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"25ba3a2b82ef44b9429794658c0a206886235a98ea0cab9a3e9afe6d35d6e959","ja":"それじゃあ、またあとで。\nみんな、頑張ろうねぇ♪","zh":"那就，待会儿见。\n大家，一起加油吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e684a5f188acfc2c08400fc1cdf3ae8566f9770f8c00d561f053294e1a4a9975","ja":"未来、可奈、千鶴は、\nトークイベントにやってきて……","zh":"未来、可奈、千鹤来参加谈话活动……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"02b6502f0d46285a1d68f8bad7f1fb34570eea244a84bbb55cb842e9dc106f2a","ja":"BOT、本当に楽しかったんですよ！　あのときも\n志保が……あれ？　さっきもこの話したかな？","zh":"BOT，真的特别开心！那时候志保也……咦？我刚才是不是也说过这件事了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"eb0e2f91ca4d04535cdc9886c81ab51d2852755ce809f9f78b7e497a591f9c91","ja":"ふふ。それだけ印象に残っているということですわ。\nちなみに可奈は、印象に残ったバトルはありますの？","zh":"呵呵。也就是说，那场战斗给你留下了深刻的印象。\n顺便问一下，可奈有没有印象深刻的战斗呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9807d526bde6823cbbd1598a57dde36ee46101b09d65061dbb8aa8c0885ec0b2","ja":"いっぱいありますけど、千鶴さんが高級コロッケを\nバッチリ当てたのが、すごくかっこよかったです！","zh":"虽然还有很多，不过千鹤小姐精准猜中高级可乐饼的样子，实在太帅了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f6cacbbba757ead4df606af90a0c89f922bfe9f9f5dd3ebc2d7b080c14561166","ja":"あれ？　なんだかいい匂いがしてきましたよ！？\nこの美味しそうな香りって……もしかして？","zh":"咦？好像飘来了很香的味道！？\n这股闻起来很美味的香味……难道是？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1790.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"7190e6a9d41641390b5bf0a2745f6e5591f91673ed5e1c53f4be68458e49ff7a","ja":"「せっかくなので、今回もご用意いたしました～！」","zh":"难得有这个机会，这次也为您准备好了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
